        "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202cd-5729-7077-86fb-a8d43e42c441 -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 Worker leaves the final partial batch pending\n\nThe loop in `deliver_due` only visits complete batches of 20, so it neither delivers nor counts the remainder.\n\nWith 19 due jobs, `work` prints 0; with 21, it prints 20 and leaves one pending.\n\nUse `len(jobs)` as the range stop so the existing slice includes the final partial batch.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202cc-1dcb-767c-9bc3-404849a749b3/findings/01a202cd-572c-72d2-8a3a-793c021bf23e)",
